{"title":"2017 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the inequalities\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128206b7583760e7ef76e802861294c334f7ca2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8298a37872109d5a896c8e5d0d4e653895b563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;y&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a198e0d6ced768b18f5058c07a05b2675a3b692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;z&lt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" />.\nWhich of the following numbers is necessarily positive?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d7e9fd14c66475a555c79637b186142de439948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ y+x^2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ y+xz\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ y+y^2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ y+2y^2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"552\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d04c99b71a480dbfc87512c2c75a45798b83f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> must be positive because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db219c3f0681629000863a63f8b64746c0a102c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z|&gt;|y|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e5969eb59d0d2c2dc0e44a2cfcf6459ff7cc10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } y+z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>The other choices:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> grows closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> decreases and thus becomes less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b7193f66028e13f331d53ff5e6942c4b05587465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be as small as possible (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />), so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd70347c7940f63ff9417e383548564fd92aff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" /> grows close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> approaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169b8d69bd74a91e72ec43123070d770633a340a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> For all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8298a37872109d5a896c8e5d0d4e653895b563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1&lt;y&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/4/294fbeefa29a1d1e254ede9f10b211e9679a7d62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|y|&gt;|y^2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" />, and thus it is always negative.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b305929a95b53f14a0ad53eba1d8560626e1f28b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> The same logic as above, but when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d53358c9b98707c0f81a1873111659fc319e88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}&lt;y&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"94\" height=\"37\" /> this time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BnkFy36V_WE\">https://youtu.be/BnkFy36V_WE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zTGuz6EoBWY?t=525\">https://youtu.be/zTGuz6EoBWY?t=525</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B\">2017 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<t